WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.512
A complete L L M application has controls before, around, and after the model.

00:00:06.512 --> 00:00:15.512
Before the model, we may have authentication, authorization, retrieval filters, and input validation.

00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:23.032
Around the model, we construct prompts, call the L L M, and orchestrate approved tools.

00:00:23.032 --> 00:00:31.542
After the model, we validate outputs, verify citations, log important events, collect metrics, evaluate quality,

00:00:31.542 --> 00:00:39.724
and monitor behavior. The model is one component inside that larger software system.
